       2000-PROCESO.
      ****************

           MOVE 'N' TO SW-FIN-FICH-PEND.
           MOVE 'N' TO SW-FIN-FICH-PAG.
           PERFORM 2005-LEER-PAG.
           PERFORM 2010-LEER-PEND.

           PERFORM 2015-ESCRIBIR-SALIDA UNTIL SI-FIN-FICH-PAG OR
                                              SI-FIN-FICH-PEND.

      *---------------------*
       2015-ESCRIBIR-SALIDA.
      *---------------------*

           IF RE1-KPOLIZA = RE2-KPOLIZA
              WRITE RLIQ-PAG-PEND FROM RE1-ENTRADA1
              ADD 1 TO CT-GRABADOS
              PERFORM 2005-LEER-PAG
           ELSE
              IF RE1-KPOLIZA < RE2-KPOLIZA
                 PERFORM 2005-LEER-PAG
              ELSE
                 IF RE1-KPOLIZA > RE2-KPOLIZA
                    PERFORM 2010-LEER-PEND
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           END-IF.

      *---------------*
       2005-LEER-PAG.
      *---------------*

           READ FICH-PAG INTO RE1-ENTRADA1
                AT END MOVE 'S' TO SW-FIN-FICH-PAG
           END-READ.

           IF NO-FIN-FICH-PAG
              ADD 1 TO CT-LEIDOS-PAG
           END-IF.

      *---------------*
       2010-LEER-PEND.
      *---------------*

           READ FICH-PEND INTO RE2-ENTRADA2
                AT END MOVE 'S' TO SW-FIN-FICH-PEND
           END-READ.

           IF NO-FIN-FICH-PEND
              ADD 1 TO CT-LEIDOS-PEND
           END-IF.

